13. NORMALIZED RESPONSE CALCULATION
======================================================================

Panel F uses the 1.00 g value as the reference denominator.

For each endpoint:

Normalized response (%) =
[value at gravity condition / value at 1.00 g] × 100

Formally:

E_p(g) = [E(g) / E(1.00 g)] × 100

where:

E(g) =
endpoint value at the specified gravitational condition

E(1.00 g) =
corresponding endpoint value under terrestrial 1.00 g loading.

Therefore:

At 1.00 g:

E_p = 100%

The normalization must be performed separately for each endpoint.

No alternative denominator may be used for Panel F.

